node_modules/
# NOT dist/ — Render's build->deploy handoff only carries forward files
# that are visible to it as build output, and in practice that excludes
# gitignored paths even though tsc creates dist/ successfully during the
# Build phase. Un-ignoring it here is what makes `node dist/index.js`
# (the Start Command) actually find something to run. See DEPLOY_RENDER.md
# troubleshooting section: "Cannot find module .../backend/dist/index.js".
.env
*.log
